{"speciesId":141,"names":{"fr":"Kabutops","es":"Kabutops","en":"Kabutops","ja":"カブトプス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Its sleek shape is perfect for swim­ ming. It slashes prey with its claws and drains the body fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Its sleek shape is perfect for swim­ ming. It slashes prey with its claws and drains the body fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"A slim and fast swimmer. It slices its prey with its sharp sickles and drinks the body fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"In the water, it tucks in its limbs to become more compact, then it wiggles its shell to swim fast."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"With sharp claws, this ferocious, ancient POKéMON rips apart prey and sucks their body fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It was able to swim quickly thro­ ugh the water by compactly folding up its razor-sharp sickles."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"KABUTOPS swam underwater to hunt for its prey in ancient times. The POKéMON was apparently evolving from being a water-dweller to living on land as evident from the beginnings of change in its gills and legs."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"KABUTOPS swam underwater to hunt for its prey in ancient times. The POKéMON was apparently evolving from being a water-dweller to living on land as evident from the beginnings of change in its gills and legs."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"KABUTOPS once swam underwater to hunt for prey. It was apparently evolving from being a water dweller to living on land as evident from changes in its gills and legs."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It swims freely through water. It catches prey with its scythe-like arms and drains the victim’s fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its sleek shape is perfect for swimming. It slashes prey with its claws and drains their fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"In the water, it tucks in its limbs to become more compact, then it wiggles its shell to swim fast."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"With sharp claws, this ferocious, ancient Pokémon rips apart prey and sucks their body fluids."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On pense que ce Pokémon est venu sur la terre ferme pour suivre l’évolution de ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"On pense que ce Pokémon est venu sur la terre ferme pour suivre l’évolution de ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Dans l’eau, il se recroqueville sur ses jambes et il agite sa coquille pour nager à très grande vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Repliega sus extremidades en el agua para hacerse más compacto, y mueve su concha para nadar rápido."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"In the water, it tucks in its limbs to become more compact, then it wiggles its shell to swim fast."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"水中を 移動するとき 手足を 小さく 折りたたみ 甲羅を くねらせ 速く 泳ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"C’est un très bon nageur. Il lacère sa proie de ses longues griffes et en absorbe les fluides corporels."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Este Pokémon es un hábil y rápido nadador. Atrapa a su presa para drenar sus fluidos vitales."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A slim and fast swimmer. It slices its prey with its sharp sickles and drinks the body fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"細い 体で 素早く 泳ぐ。 捕らえた 獲物は カマで 切り裂き 体液を 吸っていたらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Jadis, Kabutops plongeait dans les profondeurs pour trouver ses proies. Apparemment, ce Pokémon vivant sur terre est l’évolution d’une créature marine, comme le prouvent les changements dans ses branchies."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hace mucho tiempo, Kabutops buceaba para atrapar a sus presas. Parece ser que en algún momento cambió de hábitat y se adaptó a vivir en tierra firme. La transformación que se aprecia en las patas y branquias así lo confirma."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Kabutops swam underwater to hunt for its prey in ancient times. The Pokémon was apparently evolving from being a water dweller to living on land as evident from the beginnings of change in its gills and legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"水中を 泳ぎ 獲物を 捕らえていた。 水の 生活から 地上で 暮らせるように エラや 足 などが 変化を 始めていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Jadis, Kabutops plongeait dans les profondeurs pour trouver ses proies. Apparemment, ce Pokémon vivant sur terre est l’évolution d’une créature marine, comme le prouvent les changements dans ses branchies."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hace mucho tiempo, Kabutops buceaba para atrapar a sus presas. Parece ser que en algún momento cambió de hábitat y se adaptó a vivir en tierra firme. La transformación que se aprecia en las patas y branquias así lo confirma."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Kabutops swam underwater to hunt for its prey in ancient times. The Pokémon was apparently evolving from being a water dweller to living on land as evident from the beginnings of change in its gills and legs."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"水中を 泳ぎ 獲物を 捕らえていた。 水の 生活から 地上で 暮らせるように エラや 足 などが 変化を 始めていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son corps avait commencé à évoluer pour s’adapter à la vie sur la terre ferme, mais il était déjà trop tard, et son espèce s’est éteinte."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Empezó a desarrollar rasgos de adaptación a la vida en tierra firme, pero fue demasiado tarde para evitar la extinción de la especie."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its body had begun to change so it could function on land. But it didn’t adapt in time and went extinct."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"陸でも 活動 できるよう 身体が 変化を 始めていたが 間に合わず 絶滅 してしまった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Capable d’atteindre une vitesse de 29 nœuds, il se rue sur ses proies pour les transpercer de ses lames."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Nada a una velocidad de 29 nudos. Se abalanza sobre su presa y la desgarra con sus afiladas patas antes de asestar el golpe de gracia."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It swims at speeds of roughly 29 knots, quickly closing in on its prey and slashing into them with its scythes to finish them off."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"およそ ２９ノットで 泳ぐ。 素早く 獲物に 近付くと カマで 切り裂き 止めを 刺す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Ce Pokémon au corps fin est très bon nageur. Il lacère sa proie de ses longues griffes pour en absorber les fluides corporels."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Este Pokémon es un rápido nadador gracias a su cuerpo esbelto. Con las garras despedaza las presas que atrapa para sorber sus fluidos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"A slim and fast swimmer. It sliced its prey with its sharp sickles and drank the body fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"細い 体で すばやく 泳ぐ。 捕らえた 獲物は カマで 切りさき 体液を 吸っていたらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Ce Pokémon au corps fin est très bon nageur. Il lacère sa proie de ses longues griffes pour en absorber les fluides corporels."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Este Pokémon es un rápido nadador gracias a su cuerpo esbelto. Con las garras despedaza las presas que atrapa para sorber sus fluidos."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"A slim and fast swimmer. It sliced its prey with its sharp sickles and drank the body fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"細い 体で すばやく 泳ぐ。 捕らえた 獲物は カマで 切りさき 体液を 吸っていたらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il lacère sa proie pour boire ses fluides corporels, puis jette son corps en pâture à d’autres Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Despedaza a las presas que atrapa para sorber sus fluidos y deja los restos para que otros Pokémon den buena cuenta de ellos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Kabutops slices its prey apart and sucks out the fluids. The discarded body parts become food for other Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"獲物を 切り裂き 体液を すする。 残った 体は ほかのポケモンの エサになる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Nul ne sait pourquoi il s’est éteint. Ce Pokémon préhistorique féroce vivait dans les mers chaudes."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se desconoce el motivo de la extinción de este feroz Pokémon prehistórico que habitaba en los cálidos mares de antaño."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The cause behind the extinction of this species is unknown. Kabutops were aggressive Pokémon that inhabited warm seas."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"絶滅の 理由は 不明。 暖かい 海に 暮らしていた 凶暴な 古代のポケモン。"}],"varieties":[{"id":141,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[1,"level-u